  "details": "PHP is an HTML-embedded scripting language commonly used with the Apache HTTP Server.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * php: php: Denial of Service via unbounded recursion in SOAP parser (CVE-2026-91765)\n  * php: OOM bailout during request parsing leads to memory corruption and RCE (CVE-2026-109618)\n  * php: fatal error handling retains stale request state leading to use-after-free (CVE-2026-109619)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
